# P9 (ref/ff-imx-port-plan.md): the Play stop lock on the Tracker+ sim. Switched on in Config > Features, then on the Pattern screen Play starts the
# pattern, a second Play does NOT stop it (the clock keeps running), Shift + Play stops it (the clock is back at 0m:00s). Plus only: the Mini maps Play to
# another key (Mini keys are P8), its lock is checked by plus_remote_sim.sh mini R2.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh plus
title: Play stop lock on Tracker+ (P9)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

use boot-to-pattern
use goto-config
use open-config-group group="Features"
use seek-row text="Play stop lock"
tap F8
wait 500ms
tap F8
wait 500ms
use expect-text text="On: Play does not stop a running song"
enc +1
wait 600ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
use goto-pattern
use play wait=1500ms
tap Play
wait 1200ms
expect no-text "0m:00s"
shot locked-still-playing
use shift-tap key=Play wait=1s
expect text "0m:00s"
shot stopped
